+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: Fact 1 gives breadth-first search in the power automaton, with "
+        "O(|Sigma| |Q| 2^|Q|) worst-case time; at the shipping preset it solved "
+        "8/8 instances using 2,189 visited subsets, 115,428 transition lookups "
